{"processInformation": {"dataSetInformation": {"UUID": "c4293a12-5023-4e57-bdcd-9b52fbfa6a58", "name": {"baseName": [{"value": "Damp insulation PA", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Dampfbremse PA", "lang": "de"}], "functionalUnitFlowProperties": [{"value": "PA", "lang": "en"}]}, "classificationInformation": {"classification": [{"class": [{"value": "Kunststoffe", "level": 0, "classId": "6"}, {"value": "Folien und Vliese", "level": 1, "classId": "6.6"}, {"value": "Dampfbremse / Dampfsperre", "level": 2, "classId": "6.6.02"}], "name": "oekobau.dat"}]}, "generalComment": [{"value": "This data set has been modeled according to the European Standard EN 15804+A2 for Sustainable Building. Results are depicted in modules that allow the structured expression of results over the entire life cycle.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Dieser Datensatz wurde nach dem European Standard EN 15804+A2 für Nachhaltiges Bauen modelliert. Ergebnisse werden in Modulen abgebildet, die den strukturierten Ausdruck von Ergebnissen über den gesamten Lebenszyklus zulassen.", "lang": "de"}], "other": {"anies": [{"margins": 20, "description": [{"value": "Product system depicted except for a few missing processes / flows. Technological, temporal and geographic representativeness partly given.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Produktsystem bis auf wenige Prozesse/Flüsse abgebildet. Technologische, zeitliche und geographische Repräsentativität teilweise gegeben.", "lang": "de"}]}]}}, "quantitativeReference": {"referenceToReferenceFlow": [100095], "type": "Reference flow(s)"}, "time": {"referenceYear": 2023, "dataSetValidUntil": 2026, "timeRepresentativenessDescription": [{"value": "Annual average", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Jährlicher Durchschnitt", "lang": "de"}]}, "geography": {"locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction": {"descriptionOfRestrictions": [{"value": "The data set represents the country specific situation in Germany, focusing on the main technologies, the region specific characteristics and / or import statistics.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Der Datensatz bildet die länderspezifische Situation in Deutschland ab. Dabei werden Haupttechnologien, spezifische regionale Charakteristiken und ggf. Importstatistiken berücksichtigt.", "lang": "de"}], "location": "DE"}}, "technology": {"technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses": [{"value": "The LCA of the vapour barrier covers the cradle-to-gate phase. The system boundaries are represented by the finished product. 10% of antimony trioxide has been used as flame retardant. Transports from the factory to the point of installation are not considered and must be included according to the system boundaries. Production of PA 6: Nylon 6 is produced from caprolactam which is synthesized from benzene, ammonia, hydrogen and sulphuric acid (oleum). Via the intermediate products cyclohexane and cyclohexanone, the monomer caprolactam is produced. The Nylon 6 is produced by the reaction of caprolactam with water over producing the intermediate product aminocaproic acid. The acid is formed by ring- opening of caprolactam when water is added. Caprolactam and water are therefore heated to 250°C. Nylon 6 is then formed by the copolymerization of caprolactam and aminocaproic acid. The process can be carried out batchwise or continuously.\n\nIn module C1, a manual dismantling (no loads) is assumed, collecting losses are neglected.\nThe transport in module C2 to the recycling plant takes place with a truck (50km).\nModule C3 takes into account the grinding and thermal treatment (combustion) of the material. When calculating combustion emissions and credits, the specific calorific value of each material and the material composition are taken into account.\nIn module D credits for the substitution of electricity (German electricity mix) and thermal energy (from natural gas) are given.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Die Ökobilanzierung umfasst die Rohstoffbereitstellung, den Rohstofftransport und den Herstellungsaufwand für eine Polyamid-Dampfsperre sowie die Entsorgung. Transporte vom Werk zum Einbauort sind nicht berücksichtigt und sollten nach Bedarf nachträglich einbezogen werden.\nZur Herstellung von Polyamid: PA 6 wird aus Caprolactam hergestellt, welches aus Benzen, Ammoniak, Wasserstoff und Schwefelsäure synthetisiert wird. Über die Zwischenprodukte Cyclohexan und Cyclohexanon entsteht Caprolactam. Nach Reaktion mit heißem Wasser (250°C) entsteht Aminocapronsäure.  Danach bildet sich aus der Copolymerisation von Caprolactam und Aminocapronsäure Polyamid PA6. Der Prozess kann schubweise als Batch-Prozess oder fortlaufend erfolgen. \n\nIn Modul C1 wird ein manueller Rückbau (lastenfrei) angenommen. Sammelverluste werden vernachlässigt.\nDer Transport in Modul C2 zur Verwertungsanlage erfolgt mit einem LKW (50km). \nIn Modul C3 wird die Zerkleinerung und thermische Behandlung (Verbrennung) des Materials berücksichtigt. Bei der Berechnung der Verbrennungsemissionen und Gutschriften wird der spezifische Heizwert des jeweiligen Materials sowie die Materialzusammensetzung berücksichtigt.\nIn Modul D erfolgen Gutschriften für die Substitution von Strom (deutscher Strommix) und thermischer Energie (aus Erdgas).", "lang": "de"}], "technologicalApplicability": [{"value": "This product can be used in construction.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Dieses Produkt kann im Baubereich verwendet werden.", "lang": "de"}], "referenceToTechnologyFlowDiagrammOrPicture": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "construction_de_damp insulation pa.jpg", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "21e2832b-891c-4658-b72c-93fc45ec0f08", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../sources/21e2832b-891c-4658-b72c-93fc45ec0f08.xml"}]}}, "modellingAndValidation": {"LCIMethodAndAllocation": {"typeOfDataSet": "EPD", "other": {"anies": [{"name": "subType", "value": "generic dataset"}]}}, "dataSourcesTreatmentAndRepresentativeness": {"referenceToDataSource": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "EMISSION SCENARIO DOCUMENT ON PLASTICS ADDITIVES, pg. 118 bis 125, 2004", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "b10f2c2d-c801-4604-a3ac-56011cd688d0", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../sources/b10f2c2d-c801-4604-a3ac-56011cd688d0.xml"}, {"shortDescription": [{"value": "Plastics Europe Association of Plastics Manufacturers, 2006", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "ef0ac214-84b1-45e5-b271-7ef9e66d5fd8", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../sources/ef0ac214-84b1-45e5-b271-7ef9e66d5fd8.xml"}, {"shortDescription": [{"value": "Additive in Kunststoffen, 1990", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "f8c33713-ccf6-42cf-86a3-3e3d65f076c1", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../sources/f8c33713-ccf6-42cf-86a3-3e3d65f076c1.xml"}, {"shortDescription": [{"value": "Documentation of data quality management", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "e3bd9bbf-2c3c-42aa-8892-fd13f1065ca5", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../sources/e3bd9bbf-2c3c-42aa-8892-fd13f1065ca5.xml"}, {"shortDescription": [{"value": "GaBi Database Edition 2021, CUP2021.01", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "1cece811-7501-44d4-8067-9259bd5cb835", "version": "00.01.000", "uri": "../sources/1cece811-7501-44d4-8067-9259bd5cb835.xml"}, {"shortDescription": [{"value": "Sphera Managed LCA Content Databases (all versions)", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "28d74cc0-db8b-4d7e-bc44-5f6d56ce0c4a", "version": "00.03.002", "uri": "../sources/28d74cc0-db8b-4d7e-bc44-5f6d56ce0c4a.xml"}], "useAdviceForDataSet": [{"value": "The data set represents a cradle to gate inventory. It can be used to characterise the supply chain situation of the respective commodity in a representative manner. Combination with individual unit processes using this commodity enables the generation of user-specific (product) LCAs.", "lang": "en"}, {"value": "Der Datensatz repräsentiert ein Cradle to Gate Inventar. Er kann verwendet werden, um die Lieferkette des jeweiligen Produktes in einer repräsentativen Weise zu charakterisieren. Die Kombination mit einzelnen Einheitenprozessen und diesem Produkt ermöglicht die Erstellung von anwenderspezifischen (Produkt-) LCAs.", "lang": "de"}]}, "validation": {"review": [{"referenceToNameOfReviewerAndInstitution": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "Sphera Solutions GmbH", "lang": "en"}], "type": "contact data set", "refObjectId": "d7fa0337-f279-430d-becf-7f3111a85010", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../contacts/d7fa0337-f279-430d-becf-7f3111a85010.xml"}], "type": "Dependent internal review"}, {"referenceToNameOfReviewerAndInstitution": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "Sphera Product Sustainability user forum", "lang": "en"}], "type": "contact data set", "refObjectId": "8f1306f0-7b83-4f36-a537-aa83f0498266", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../contacts/8f1306f0-7b83-4f36-a537-aa83f0498266.xml"}], "type": "Independent external review"}]}, "complianceDeclarations": {"compliance": [{"referenceToComplianceSystem": {"shortDescription": [{"value": "EN 15804+A2 (EF 3.1)", "lang": "de"}, {"value": "EN 15804+A2 (EF 3.1)", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "d4aa3ec7-b1d7-4a4a-a6cb-37af88dcc902", "version": "00.01.000", "uri": "../sources/d4aa3ec7-b1d7-4a4a-a6cb-37af88dcc902.xml"}, "approvalOfOverallCompliance": "Fully compliant"}]}}, "administrativeInformation": {"dataGenerator": {"referenceToPersonOrEntityGeneratingTheDataSet": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "Sphera Solutions GmbH", "lang": "en"}], "type": "contact data set", "refObjectId": "d7fa0337-f279-430d-becf-7f3111a85010", "version": "24.01.000", "uri": "../contacts/d7fa0337-f279-430d-becf-7f3111a85010.xml"}]}, "dataEntryBy": {"timeStamp": 1718121637000, "referenceToDataSetFormat": [{"shortDescription": [{"value": "ILCD format 1.1", "lang": "de"}, {"value": "ILCD format 1.1", "lang": "en"}], "type": "source data set", "refObjectId": "a97a0155-0234-4b87-b4ce-a45da52f2a40", "version": "01.00.000", "uri": "../sources/a97a0155-0234-